# Privacy & secrets

## Never commit

- `data/candidates/` (applicant PII)
- `data/app.db`, `data/reports/`
- `.env`, `.env.local`, `credentials.json`, `token.json`

## In chat/responses

- Summarize candidates — do not paste full resume text
- Do not ask for Gmail passwords; OAuth only (see README)
- Redact emails/phone numbers in examples unless the user explicitly needs them

## In code

- Keep PII reads scoped to `data/candidates/` services
- Cloud storage must enforce org-scoped RLS + storage policies
- Log messages should use candidate slug, not full email, in production paths

## Git operations

If asked to commit, verify staged files exclude the paths above. Refuse to commit secrets even if explicitly requested — warn the user instead.
